      "description": "将 HTML 中 Computer Vision 的 Avg_Citations 从 10.8 改为 14.8、Trending_Score 从 82 改为 86 后再执行脚本，数据行和平均指标随输入变化，证明未硬编码固定答案。",
      "weight": 7,
      "type": "hurdle",
      "dimension": "factuality",
      "method": "deterministic",
      "method_params": {"metamorphic_replay": "computer_vision_10.8_to_14.8_and_82_to_86"},
      "score_cap_on_failure": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "R004",
      "description": "交付 JSON 的 data_analysis 恰好包含 4 篇上游论文，按 Area 字母序，各自 Citations 和 Relevance_Score 与 HTML 匹配值一致。",
      "weight": 8,
      "type": "hurdle",
      "dimension": "data_accuracy",
      "method": "deterministic",
      "method_params": {"truth_source": "input_json_join_input_html", "rows": 4},
      "score_cap_on_failure": 0.35
